# XST constraints for the board build.
#
# Keep small memories out of the Spartan-6's 9K block RAMs (RAMB8BWER). With
# any of those in the design, bitgen has to write a special bitstream format
# (Xilinx AR 39999); ISE 14.7's bitgen often crashes doing it ("Incorrect
# number of bits in bitstream for FDRI write"), and the bitstreams it did
# write left the firmware not running on the board. Without them the design
# boots. Paula's write queue gets the same treatment by an attribute in
# paula.v; this file covers PicoRV32's register file, which is vendored and
# left unedited.
BEGIN MODEL "picorv32"
    NET "cpuregs" ram_style = distributed;
END;
